install argocd website ---------------------> https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/en/stable/getting_started/

kubectl create namespace argocd -------------> command to create namespace with name argocd

kubectl apply -n argocd -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argo-cd/stable/manifests/install.yml -------------> command to install argocd

kubectl get all -n argocd ---------> command to view list namespace with name argocd

kubectl patch svc argocd-server -n argocd -p '{"spec": {"type": LoadBalancer"}}' ------------> command to patch argocd

